nkedIn profile, resume, or CV. Share it on social media and in your performance review. Instructor Instructor ratings 4.5 ( 3,043 ratings ) Google Cloud Training Google Cloud 2,297 Courses • 4,475,254 learners Offered by Google Cloud Learn more Explore more from Cloud Computing Related Degrees Google Cloud Introduction to Large Language Models Course Google Cloud Responsible AI: Applying AI Principles with Google Cloud Course Google Cloud Introduction to Responsible AI Course Why people choose Coursera for their career Felipe M. Learner since 2018 \"To be able to take courses at my own pace and rhythm has been an amazing experience. I can learn whenever it fits my schedule and mood.\" Jennifer J. Learner since 2020 \"I directly applied the concepts and skills I learned from my courses to an exciting new project at work.\" Larry W. Learner since 2021 \"When I need courses on topics that my university doesn't offer, Coursera is one of the best places to go.\" Chaitanya A. \"Learning isn't just about being better at your job: it's so much more than that. Coursera allows me to learn without limits.\" Learner reviews 4.7 12,108 reviews 5 stars 79.20% 4 stars 14.97% 3 stars 3.35% 2 stars 0.87% 1 star 1.58% Showing 3 of 12108 Y YB 5 · Reviewed on Oct 13, 2025 Great Course on Gen AI , and to be recommended to all college Engineering Students and the ones who are keen on learning on Gen AI and its Models to work on projects and other works N NG 4 · Reviewed on Apr 30, 2024 It is a good course,gives me a lot of knowledge about what is generative ai and discriminative ai,how to write a prompt and get appropriate answer regarding to your prompt writing. A AN 5 · Reviewed on Jun 8, 2025 Gave me a clear understanding of how ai works. The lecture explains it so perfectly in a way that is not boring, make sure that you are physical and emotional in there keep it up. View more reviews Unlock access to 10,000+ courses with a subscription Start trial Advance your career with an online